#X text 20 2080 slave / tempo / quantize (route-list reject -- 2026-09-18 \, 1:1 mlrv recreation item 2 slave wiring). table mlrv-mslave 8 tracks each slot's tempo-slave flag (0 = immediate \, default). trigger path: pack output splits through t l l -- outlet 1 (first) reads the slot flag and pre-sets the spigot pair \, outlet 0 (second) delivers through exactly one of them. held triggers cold-store in the 5-inlet pack and fire on clock.pd's release bang (last-write-wins). LED stays immediate. outlet 2 = clock beat pulse. limits: stopall does not cancel a held trigger \, direct file_poly play messages are never gated \, no grid gesture sets slave/tempo/quantize yet.;
