#X text 20 3820 grid gestures (2026-09-18 \, user-picked direct-rows layout). y=6 buttons: x0-3 groupstop 1-4 (control outlet) \, x4/5/6 arm/play/stop (outlet 3 -> pattern_recorder) \, x7 record (outlet 4 -> record_buffer~) \, LED flash on press + clear on release (y=6 releases newly routed -- all other releases still ignored). y=5 cycles slot group 0-4 via shadow mlrv-mgroup (LED = group*3) + group msg to file_poly -- shadow drifts after remote group edits (no group dump to sync from). y=4 toggles slot slave in mlrv-mslave itself (LED 15/0). voice gain/pitch/mode have NO gesture (voices vs slots -- needs untracked voice mapping) -- GUI/OSC only. outlets 3/4 added at x=450/600 so 0/1/2 keep indices.;
